## Our Direction

In the first half of 2026, Bluebook continues to start from **real business workflows** — helping companies adopt practical AI and automation solutions. We don't just recommend tools; we analyse processes with clients, identify high-value scenarios, and design systems that can be continuously improved.

## Recent Focus

- **WhatsApp AI Agent** official release, serving engineering, property, and logistics teams
- **AI OCR** solutions applied to leases, invoices, quotations, and other structured documents
- Exploring integrations with CRM, ERP, and Google Workspace for more clients

## What We Believe

> The value of AI isn't in "what new tools exist" — it's in "which workflows deserve automation and how to make teams actually use them smoothly."

If you have repetitive, time-consuming, or error-prone processes you'd like to improve, [contact us](/en/contact/) to start the conversation.
